@page "/"

<PageTitle>ATLAS Assistant</PageTitle>

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4 mb-4">ATLAS Assistant</h1>
    <p class="lead mb-4">Ultra-lightweight Personal AI Control System</p>
    
    <div class="row mb-5">
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <div class="card text-center p-3">
                <i class="bi bi-robot fs-1 text-primary mb-2"></i>
                <h5>Multi-LLM Support</h5>
                <p class="small">Claude, Gemini, Copilot, Codex</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <div class="card text-center p-3">
                <i class="bi bi-tools fs-1 text-success mb-2"></i>
                <h5>Extensible Skills</h5>
                <p class="small">Plugin architecture for custom capabilities</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <div class="card text-center p-3">
                <i class="bi bi-chat-dots fs-1 text-info mb-2"></i>
                <h5>Messaging</h5>
                <p class="small">Telegram & WhatsApp integration</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <div class="card text-center p-3">
                <i class="bi bi-clock-history fs-1 text-warning mb-2"></i>
                <h5>Automation</h5>
                <p class="small">Cron tasks & workflows</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="d-grid gap-2 d-md-flex justify-content-md-center">
        <a href="/chat" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Start Chatting</a>
        <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg">View Dashboard</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-5">
    <h2>Getting Started</h2>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h4>1. Configure Providers</h4>
            <p>Set up your preferred LLM providers by configuring their CLI tools (claude, gemini, gh copilot, codex).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h4>2. Start a Conversation</h4>
            <p>Navigate to the Chat page and start interacting with your AI assistants.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row mt-3">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h4>3. Explore Skills</h4>
            <p>Check out the available skills like FileOperations and ShellCommand, or create your own.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h4>4. Automate Workflows</h4>
            <p>Set up cron jobs and create agent-driven workflows for automation.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
